<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon’s BIR rapid intervention force has expanded its presence around Lake Chad while drones and joint border patrols continue targeting Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest, where attacks on government forces persist. Survivors of the 2016 Eseka rail disaster are still awaiting justice a decade after the crash, and a French court has authorized a third-party funder to enforce an ICC award against the state. The Supreme Court halted the appeal of a former minister sentenced for embezzlement, and a Cameroonian scholar has called for new peace talks with Anglophone separatists. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNdUVSXzNhRUdyYko2bEkzamJqR2VSaUNYYlJEeGMwZ09pdkVtVzc3UXlSeWNiOGZvNERfaWY3cUJ1anY3bTBsY3JuUUdiNVF6RVIxZndtanQ2OF9NaXlyZXdoR21aMHNlcXYyUm10dGd0VVBQY1BpQkhiMUVqLXdGeWRnaVJ5dGtpc0MtY1R5N0tHZzJma3B4ZnhzNXJoNmt1QXlHdlg2N1p3ZG5o?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPLW93ZFRQNG1CektwTG1UVEVMdDRRbmRQNVUwWlQyUHFkVVpRVHhwZ19DQlZRZW1JT3dhbllFZi1fMXA5a1FxSVc0U25XOENXNy1KOUI2T05iWHBXY2V6MkFCWGVOaU5nT3I4eklpTVd5cXlyRGRUQ3BZQllzV01XZW1jRU5LWGtHUTgwd3Q4QTNVNVV4dEc2SGdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNd09IZHRpanAzWnhuc3pPZ0tSU2lPenJmdDhpZFVwbWxSZDNfaFlYdm41eEhNaDZibHVMY1FycTlJWEJGTVFNdS1oend6c1k2aDRoempfUmM0TldwcjJBbmpuWFlNZnFpYkhacjctLXVoaWFFdWxwcGJVOVBWYjQ2ZnlFYUNMX3l3MkpiV1o5UXNrUnJLOGN5V1FGekp6aFFFMkphUzJWS0pzUGxsb3V5VjNWN0dWN050LU0yQ1VoaU9jbDhaOVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPRENDakN3ZXZYLXJQR0l4aTlfdk5lWn